#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid "A reference's %(parts)s is not read: nothing prints it. Each reference is added as not yet asked, so none is printed until you say they agreed."
msgstr "Ni ddarllenir %(parts)s geirda: nid oes dim yn ei argraffu. Ychwanegir pob geirda fel un nas gofynnwyd amdano eto, felly ni chaiff yr un ei argraffu nes i chi ddweud eu bod wedi cytuno."

